WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS, AND WHAT IT DOES NOT
----------------------------------------------

This repository contains two kinds of material, under different terms. Read this
section before relying on anything below it.

COVERED by this licence — SyMoNeuRaL's own work:

    work/recipes/**          recipes, classes and layer configuration
    work/runtimes/*/app/**   first-party application source
    work/tools/**            build, scan, verify and proof tooling
    work/config/**           deployment configuration
    production/**            proof output and build records
    reports/**               dated records
    scripts/**, symonlearn, CMakeLists.txt, README.md, BUILD.md

NOT COVERED by this licence — third-party source acquired at pinned commits:

    upstream/**

Every tree under upstream/ is the work of its own authors and remains under its own
licence. Nothing in this file grants, restricts, or otherwise affects any right in
that material. Each acquired tree keeps its own licence file, and the recipe that
builds it records that licence and a checksum of its text read from the tree itself.

A build of this software combines both kinds of material. When it is distributed,
the third-party terms travel with it; see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.


