MODEL WEIGHTS
-------------

No model weights are contained in this repository, and none are licensed by this
file. Weights are acquired separately, carry their own terms, and those terms travel
with them. The runtime reads them from a path given at run time and never packages
them.


ON THE SPDX IDENTIFIER
----------------------

First-party recipes declare LICENSE = "CLOSED", which is the OpenEmbedded convention
for material that is not distributed under an open-source licence. That declaration
now has this text behind it. Before, it had none, which meant a licence audit of a
build produced nothing at all for SyMoNeuRaL's own code.


REVIEW STATUS
-------------

This text was drafted to record the position the repository already took in its
recipes, and to scope it correctly against the acquired material. It has not been
reviewed by a lawyer. If this software is distributed outside SymonSays LLC, that
review should happen first — in particular on the covered/not-covered boundary above,
which is the part most likely to matter.
